1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
@StarlightTheatre{Event:Cue|id=empty_theatre|act=1|kind=action|shot=wide}

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:23,000
{Event:Cue|id=noa_enters|kind=action|shot=entry}

3
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
{Event:Cue|id=puppet_unfolds|kind=action|shot=puppet}

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
{Event:Cue|id=welcome|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]欢迎！你是今天第一位会呼吸的观众。

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,000
{Event:Cue|id=ask_name|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Noa]你叫什么？

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:47,000
{Event:Cue|id=forget_name|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]我叫……哎呀，等谢幕后再说！

7
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:54,000
{Event:Cue|id=hold_hand_name|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Noa]名字怎么能等？

8
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:04,000
{Event:Cue|id=vesper_descends|kind=action|shot=wide}

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:11,000
{Event:Cue|id=applause_claim|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Vesper]每一声掌声，都能点亮一颗星。

10
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:16,000
{Event:Cue|id=empty_chairs|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Noa]可椅子都是空的。

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,000
{Event:Cue|id=loyal_audience|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Vesper]最忠诚的观众，不必露面。

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
{Event:Cue|id=wind_up|kind=action|shot=wide}

13
00:01:30,000 --> 00:02:30,000
{Event:Cue|id=applause_machine|kind=song|song=applause_machine|shot=ensemble}

14
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
{Event:Cue|id=name_after_song|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]我刚才是不是说过我的名字？

15
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:40,000
{Event:Cue|id=steal_memory|kind=action|shot=memory}

16
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:52,000
{Event:Cue|id=approach_piano|act=2|kind=action|shot=piano_wide}

17
00:02:52,000 --> 00:02:58,000
{Event:Cue|id=selene_breath|kind=action|shot=piano_trio}

18
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:06,000
{Event:Cue|id=sing_to_me|kind=dialogue|shot=piano_trio}
[Noa]不用唱给他们听。先唱给我听。

19
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:15,000
{Event:Cue|id=wooden_heartbeat|kind=action|shot=piano_trio}

20
00:03:15,000 --> 00:04:05,000
{Event:Cue|id=borrow_a_melody|kind=song|song=borrow_a_melody|shot=piano_trio}

21
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:15,000
{Event:Cue|id=names_on_paper|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]每次谢幕，我就忘记一个人。

22
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:22,000
{Event:Cue|id=demand_paper|kind=dialogue|shot=ensemble}
[Vesper]把纸条交出来。

23
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:28,000
{Event:Cue|id=shield_pip|kind=action|shot=ensemble}

24
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:35,000
{Event:Cue|id=what_did_you_take|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Noa]你拿走了什么？

25
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:43,000
{Event:Cue|id=theatre_will_fall|act=3|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Vesper]没有掌声，剧院会坠落！

26
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:51,000
{Event:Cue|id=memories_as_fuel|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Noa]你把他们的记忆当燃料。

27
00:04:51,000 --> 00:05:00,000
{Event:Cue|id=why_i_stand_here|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]我连为什么站在这里都忘了。

28
00:05:00,000 --> 00:06:05,000
{Event:Cue|id=return_my_name|kind=song|song=return_my_name|shot=confrontation}

29
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:13,000
{Event:Cue|id=pip_chooses|kind=dialogue|shot=pip_string}
[Pip]我宁愿跌倒，也不要忘记朋友！

30
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:17,000
{Event:Cue|id=break_string|kind=action|shot=ensemble}

31
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:24,000
{Event:Cue|id=catch_selene|kind=action|shot=rescue}

32
00:06:24,000 --> 00:06:32,000
{Event:Cue|id=four_person_chain|kind=action|shot=rescue}

33
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:40,000
{Event:Cue|id=regain_support|kind=action|shot=rescue}

34
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:44,000
{Event:Cue|id=quiet_breath|act=4|kind=action|shot=ensemble}

35
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:52,000
{Event:Cue|id=without_applause|kind=dialogue|shot=vesper_noa}
[Vesper]没有掌声，我不知道怎样让它飞。

36
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:58,000
{Event:Cue|id=listen_to_her|kind=dialogue|shot=piano_trio}
[Noa]先听她想说什么。

37
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,000
{Event:Cue|id=selene_inhales|kind=action|shot=selene_vesper}

38
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:10,000
{Event:Cue|id=first_own_words|kind=dialogue|shot=selene_vesper}
[Selene]我想唱。不是因为你命令我，是因为我想让他们听见。

39
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:16,000
{Event:Cue|id=your_first_beat|kind=dialogue|shot=baton_handoff}
[Vesper]今晚第一拍由你决定。

40
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:20,000
{Event:Cue|id=baton_release|kind=action|shot=baton_handoff}

41
00:07:20,000 --> 00:08:45,000
{Event:Cue|id=let_stars_hear|act=5|kind=song|song=let_stars_hear|shot=finale}

42
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:52,000
{Event:Cue|id=stars_settle|kind=action|shot=audience}

43
00:08:52,000 --> 00:08:58,000
{Event:Cue|id=ask_again|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Noa]现在你叫什么？

44
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:05,000
{Event:Cue|id=pip_remembers|kind=dialogue|shot=noa_pip}
[Pip]匹普。我叫匹普。

45
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:13,000
{Event:Cue|id=bow_together|act=6|kind=action|shot=wide}

46
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:22,000
{Event:Cue|id=someone_stays|kind=dialogue|shot=ensemble}
[Vesper]原来不必拿走什么，也有人愿意留下。

47
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:27,000
{Event:Cue|id=curtain_last_star|kind=action|shot=audience}

48
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,000
{Event:Cue|id=dedication|kind=title|shot=black}
